====1F====
Defeat the single Rocket Grunt and climb to the second floor.

====2F====
There are four Rocket Grunts patrolling the second floor. Battle past them to reach the western stairs.

====3F====
Battle another two Rocket Grunts and Scientist Marc. A Card Key is required to access the eastern area, so take the western stairs instead.

====4F (West)====
Beat the Rocket Grunt and Scientist Rich to reach the stairs to the Director's office.

====5F (West)====
The Director is being held captive here in his office, or at least that is how it seems at first. This man is an imposter, and is actually [[Petrel|a Rocket Executive]] in disguise. Prepare for battle!

