When the battle ends, the Executive reveals that the real Director is being held in the Underground Warehouse, behind the locked door in [[Goldenrod Tunnel|the Underground]]'s access hallway. He doubts that you will even get that far, and hands over the {{jo|Basement Key}}.

===Goldenrod Underground===
[[File:The Underground Basement GSC.png|thumb|Underground, B2F]]
[[File:Underground Warehouse GSC.png|thumb|Underground, Warehouse]]

A Rocket Grunt guards the south alley behind the Pokémon Center, so enter [[Goldenrod Tunnel|the Underground]] from the north instead. Take the access hallway and use the {{jo|Basement Key}} to unlock the door. Go down the stairs in the next room to reach the Underground Warehouse.

