====B2F====
{{ga|Silver}} appears again a short distance from the entrance. He intends to be the one to finally defeat [[Team Rocket]], and plans to defeat you to get you out of his way.

=====Rival Battle 4=====
Each of {{ga|Silver}}'s Pokémon has grown 10 levels since the previous battle. His {{p|Zubat}} has since evolved into {{p|Golbat}}, and the Pokémon that he took from {{prof|Elm}}'s lab—either {{p|Totodile}} or {{p|Chikorita}}—has now evolved into its final form. His team includes one new addition, a {{p|Sneasel}}. As a {{2t|Dark|Ice}} Pokémon, it takes massive damage from {{type|Fighting}} moves.

