Afterward, the trio explains that they have been charged with protecting the legendary Pokémon, and are to allow passage only to those who possess "the power and soul of truth". They invite you to enter the tower, where {{p|Suicune}} awaits. Follow the trail to the tower, and be sure to save the game.

===Tin Tower===
====1F====
When you step inside, the three [[legendary beasts]] can be seen standing together near the central pillar. Immediately noticing your presence, {{p|Raikou}} and {{p|Entei}} each leap over the fence with a roar before racing out of the tower. {{p|Suicune}} clears the fence with a roar of its own and lands directly in front of you, forcing you into battle.

=====VS Suicune=====
The legendary {{p|Suicune}} has appeared! Begin with {{t|Grass}}- and {{type|Electric}} attacks to wear its health down quickly, then follow up with Water-, {{t|Fire}}-, {{t|Ice}}-, and {{type|Steel}} moves to chip away at it even further. Consider inflicting status ailments like {{status|Sleep}} and {{status|Paralysis}} to restrict its movements.

