[[Eusine]] and the Wise Trio enter the tower when the battle ends. Eusine claims that {{p|Suicune}}'s mystic power is said to summon {{p|Ho-Oh|a rainbow-colored Pokémon}}, and wonders aloud if these events will cause it to appear. He intends to continue studying these legends, and thanks you for the fantastic battle as he leaves. If spoken with, the trio recounts the tale of the [[Burned Tower|Brass Tower]]; the [[Legendary beasts|three Pokémon]] that perished in the blaze, and the rainbow-colored Pokémon descending from the sky to give them new life.

The next destination is [[Blackthorn City]], to the east of [[Mahogany Town]].

==Mahogany Town==
With [[Team Rocket]] gone, the souvenir shop's owner and her granddaughter have returned to reopen their store. The shady salesman who blocked the way eastward to {{rt|44|Johto}} has disappeared, as well.

