Of the two boulders in the southwest area, begin with the southernmost one. Use {{m|Strength}} to maneuver it around the scattered rocks and drop it down through the southwest hole. Backtrack a bit and move the second boulder northward to the second hole in the floor. Head to the southeast area to find the third boulder; move it to the southeast hole, then continue northward. Finally, push the fourth boulder to the north-central hole. With all four boulders cleared, climb down the northeast ladder.

====B2F (West)====
The four boulders from the floor above have fallen in a spiral shape that grants access to the ladder in the middle of the chamber. Before continuing on, there are several items that can be found nearby, including a [[Max Potion]]. To reach the middle area, begin in the northeast corner and stand on the southwestern-most point of clear ground, then slide westward across the ice. Move in a clockwise direction from here to reach the patch of clear ground in the center, and collect the [[Full Heal]] before climbing the ladder.

====B3F====
Use {{m|Rock Smash}}, or approach from the east, to reach the [[Never-Melt Ice|NeverMeltIce]]. Climb up the eastern ladder.

====B2F (East)====
Head east, then slide southward across the smaller ice patch to reach a ledge. Move a few steps westward, then jump the ledge to slide southward. From the south wall, slide eastward to reach {{TM|44|Rest}}. Slide westward, then northward to backtrack and return to the ledge. Walk up onto the ridge, stand on the western stairway, then slide southward to the ladder.

====B1F (South)====
Go east to reach the stairway and slide out across the ice. Pick up the [[Iron]] in the tunnel to the southwest, then climb up the ladder on the northwest ridge.

